Star catalog data in this directory
==================================

starcat-g8.bin, stars-u2000.stdb, and the G <= 12 catalog that `starcat.ensure("g12")` fetches,
are derived from the catalogs below. The derived data is NOT covered by this
repository's Apache-2.0 licence. It is distributed under the Creative Commons
Attribution-NonCommercial 3.0 IGO licence (CC BY-NC 3.0 IGO):

    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/3.0/igo/

Commercial use needs prior permission from ESA (data.licences@esa.int). See
https://www.cosmos.esa.int/web/gaia-users/license and
https://www.cosmos.esa.int/web/esdc/terms-and-conditions.

Changes made: positions propagated to epoch J2024.0, magnitudes rounded to
millimag, Hipparcos V and V-I converted to Gaia G and BP-RP, and the stars
re-ordered by HEALPix cell. The files are built by
libs/metor-star/tools/starcat.

stars-u2000.stdb, the onboard star-tracker DB, is derived from
starcat-g8.bin: the 2000 Hipparcos stars left after uniformising over the
cube-face sky index, and every pair of them closer than 20 degrees. It is
built by libs/metor-star/tools/star-db.

